silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_02_convergence_algebra_concrete_anchor_r1_join_r2 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.02_convergence_algebra.concrete_anchor.r1_join_r2" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_02_convergence_algebra_concrete_anchor_r1_join_r2 silm:hasLongDescription "The MorningAndAfternoonReadingsMerged is R_1 join R_2 is the merge of the morning replica (weight=3.8kg, about=Mittens) and the afternoon replica (temp=38.6C, about=Mittens). The merged state contains both readings. This is one grouping of the first two replicas before merging with the evening reading." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_02_convergence_algebra_concrete_anchor_r1r2_join_r3 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.02_convergence_algebra.concrete_anchor.r1r2_join_r3" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_02_convergence_algebra_concrete_anchor_r1r2_join_r3 silm:hasLongDescription "The AllThreeReadingsFirstGrouping is (R_1 join R_2) join R_3 is the state with all three readings, grouped as (morning+afternoon) then evening. Result: weight=3.8kg, temp=38.6C, microchip=1234567, all about Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '(R_1 join R_2) join R_3', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_02_convergence_algebra_concrete_anchor_r1_join_r2r3 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.02_convergence_algebra.concrete_anchor.r1_join_r2r3" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_02_convergence_algebra_concrete_anchor_r1_join_r2r3 silm:hasLongDescription "The AllThreeReadingsSecondGrouping is R_1 join (R_2 join R_3) is the state with all three readings, grouped as morning then (afternoon+evening). Same result by associativity: weight=3.8kg, temp=38.6C, microchip=1234567, about Mittens. The isomorphism (cong) is the equality of these two states." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_02_convergence_algebra_concrete_anchor_mittens_apex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.02_convergence_algebra.concrete_anchor.mittens_apex" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_02_convergence_algebra_concrete_anchor_mittens_apex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedCatInConvergence is Mittens is the instancenode in the associativity diagram — the governed cat whose health readings are being merged. Both groupings of the three replicas carry lambda_gossip to Mittens. The associativity law ensures both groupings reach the same Mittens anchor." .
